   "text": "Crush Deadlines and Fire Up Games With Big Brand Laptops at JB\nToo many specs, too much jargon? Choosing a laptop shouldn’t melt your brain, and here at JB, we’ve made sure it doesn’t. Whether you’re chasing a gaming rig, a work-ready powerhouse or a no-fuss budget laptop, we’ve got the lot. Intel Core Ultra 7, AMD Ryzen 7, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050, OLED screens, SSD storage? You name it, we’ve got",
