   "textLength": 877,
   "text": "Fast Chips for Lag-Free Power: Choppy gameplay? No thanks. A high-performance CPU is key. Go for an AMD Ryzen 7, AMD Ryzen 5, Intel Core i7, Core Ultra 7 or Intel Core Ultra 5.\nVisuals That Don’t Miss a Frame: The GPU makes or breaks your gaming experience. Whether it’s an NVIDIA GeForce RTX for ray tracing or an AMD Radeon for serious grunt, a proper graphics card means smoother gameplay.\nDisplay",
