   "text": "Portability That Goes Anywhere: A lightweight laptop with a compact screen size is easy to slip into your school bag. Think MacBook Air or Lenovo Yoga.\nSpeed for Research and Multitasking: Switching between tabs or study apps? A Snapdragon or Intel Core i5 chip with SSD storage keeps things moving. Look for EVO models with instant wake and smooth multitasking, like the ASUS Zenbook or MSI Prestige",
